5
00:00:55,964 --> 00:01:21,418
听：We experienced many deeds of the early settlers, such as swinging across rivers, hunting creatures in the jungle, or taking part in sword-fighting tournaments. This park is also famous for its wooden souvenirs. Whichever we bought in the central shop was made of wood, and wherever we went we could see minority carpenters working.

